# Company profiles no longer live in this repo at all — they live in that company's
# own private repo, and a project's CLAUDE.md names the path. `companies/` here holds
# only `_template.md`, which documents the interface and contains no company information.
#
# This rule stays as a REGRESSION GUARD. The old model kept real profiles here behind
# this ignore, which was fail-open in two ways: one `git add -f` would have published
# them, and a fresh clone silently omitted them so sessions ran on wrong defaults
# without saying so. If someone drops a profile back here out of habit, this stops it
# reaching history — but the right fix is to move it to the company's own repo.
companies/*/
companies/*.md
!companies/_template.md

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
